  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-082 (Phase 4 — app: first usable build): Adaptive navigation: one `NavigationSplitView` app (iPhone, iPad, foldables) forums → topics → messages; forum list, topic list with pagination, flags/favourites; hiding the Apple category for reviewers is applied here (Q-7).\n\n### Scope\n\nAdaptive navigation: one `NavigationSplitView` app (iPhone, iPad, foldables) forums → topics → messages; forum list, topic list with pagination, flags/favourites; hiding the Apple category for reviewers is applied here (Q-7)\n\n- Module: App · Difficulty: medium · Priority: high\n- Audit source: B1-B7\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-080 (#98), LOT-021 (#49), LOT-022 (#50), LOT-024 (#52), LOT-045 (#71)\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet → Opus\n\n### Spec\n\n- [docs/lots/LOT-082-adaptive-navigation.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-082-adaptive-navigation.md)\n\n### PRs\n\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#32](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/32) — LOT-082: adaptive navigation (forums, topics, flags) (merged; work)\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#31](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/31) — chore(lots): claim LOT-081 (#99) and LOT-082 (app, Mac) (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#51](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/51) — Claim wave 4 (021, 022, 030, 033) and add app lots 080-083 (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#96](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/96) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\nHistorical owner: mac/w2-082-sonnet (2026-10-27)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `done (#32)`.\n",
